# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Drift with the Sound — Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Copy this file to .env.local for local development, or set
# the variables in your Vercel project dashboard under
#   Settings → Environment Variables
#
# NEVER commit a file containing real keys to version control.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Pexels API key — used by the /api/bg serverless function to
# fetch landscape photos that match the currently-playing song.
#
# 1. Sign up for a free key at https://www.pexels.com/api/
# 2. Copy your key below (local dev) or add it to Vercel dashboard
# 3. The key is NEVER sent to the browser; it stays server-side.
#
# Without this key the background will always fall back to the
# default moonlit river video — nothing breaks.
PEXELS_API_KEY=your_pexels_api_key_here
